484
00:31:17,048 --> 00:31:18,648
張り付けられた僕は切り捨てに
I'm cast aside,

485
00:31:18,648 --> 00:31:20,248
なったって無理ってわかっているって
knowing it's useless even if that happens,

486
00:31:20,248 --> 00:31:22,048
どうしよってなにもできない
wondering what to do, utterly powerless.

487
00:31:22,048 --> 00:31:25,148
0.02mmの壁がすげー悩ましくなって
The 0.02mm barrier becomes so terribly tormenting,

488
00:31:25,148 --> 00:31:26,748
真っ青な my sunshine
my deep blue sunshine.

489
00:31:26,748 --> 00:31:28,448
すぐに入れたくなるのは僕のせい
Wanting to put it right in is my fault.

490
00:31:28,448 --> 00:31:31,448
大丈夫とかそんな気分で甲斐性もないこんな身分で
"It'll be fine," in that mood, completely unreliable,

491
00:31:31,448 --> 00:31:34,448
泣いたって怒ったって 後の祭り
crying or getting angry won't change a thing now.

492
00:31:34,448 --> 00:31:36,448
マキシマムインサートなう
Maximum insert now.

493
00:31:36,448 --> 00:31:39,548
Are you ready? 愛撫ハニー 指噛み
Are you ready? Caressing honey, biting fingers.

494
00:31:39,548 --> 00:31:42,548
聖槍爆裂ボーイ
Sacred spear explosion boy.

495
00:31:42,548 --> 00:31:46,048
愛が feeling. I have honey. You be coming.
Love is feeling. I have honey. You be coming.

496
00:31:46,648 --> 00:31:52,448
遠い夏の思い出
Memories of a distant summer,

497
00:31:52,448 --> 00:31:58,548
君の長い髪が揺れる
your long hair swaying...

498
00:31:58,548 --> 00:32:04,548
嗚呼…
Ah...

499
00:32:23,248 --> 00:32:25,048
待ってこれって僕のせい？
Wait, is this my fault?

500
00:32:25,048 --> 00:32:26,548
「中に出して」って言った君のせい？
Or your fault for saying "finish inside"?

501
00:32:26,548 --> 00:32:28,148
そして5分で終わるテストって
And a test that finishes in five minutes...

502
00:32:28,148 --> 00:32:29,848
絶対的二元論だって
is an absolute binary matter!

503
00:32:29,848 --> 00:32:31,448
十月十日ばかりの運命を
Ruling over a destiny

504
00:32:31,448 --> 00:32:32,948
支配している僕は神様に
of mere forty weeks, can I

505
00:32:32,948 --> 00:32:34,548
なれないって無理ってわかっていて
never become a god? Knowing it's impossible,

506
00:32:34,548 --> 00:32:36,248
結局なにも解決してない
in the end nothing is solved at all.

507
00:32:36,248 --> 00:32:39,348
0.02mmの壁がすげーもどかしくなって
The 0.02mm barrier becomes so terribly frustrating,

508
00:32:39,348 --> 00:32:40,948
真っ白な my sunshine
my pure white sunshine.

509
00:32:40,948 --> 00:32:42,648
すぐに入れたくなるのは君のせい
Wanting to put it right in is all your fault.

510
00:32:42,648 --> 00:32:45,648
「いいじゃーん」とかそんな気分で迎えた君と僕そんなヘブンで
"Why not?" In that mood, you and I met in that heaven,

511
00:32:45,648 --> 00:32:48,548
しまったって思っても もう遅い
and even if we think "crap," it's already too late.

512
00:32:48,548 --> 00:32:51,048
アップサイド・インサイドアウト
Upside inside out,

513
00:32:51,048 --> 00:32:54,148
I defend you 甘噛み you の髪
I defend you, nibbling softly on your hair.

514
00:32:54,148 --> 00:32:57,148
一切合切愛で返事
Answering everything and anything with love.

515
00:32:57,148 --> 00:33:01,348
I'm coming. You're coming.

516
00:33:01,348 --> 00:33:04,248
マキシマムインサートなう
Maximum insert now.

517
00:33:04,248 --> 00:33:07,348
Are you ready? 愛撫ハニー 指噛み
Are you ready? Caressing honey, biting fingers.

518
00:33:07,348 --> 00:33:10,348
聖槍爆裂ボーイ
Sacred spear explosion boy.

519
00:33:10,348 --> 00:33:13,848
愛が feeling. I have honey. You be coming.
Love is feeling. I have honey. You be coming.

520
00:33:14,548 --> 00:33:20,548
嗚呼…
Ah...

521
00:33:34,048 --> 00:33:37,048
いやあ、まさか、聖槍でライブ会場壊しちゃうなんて
Man, who would've thought you'd destroy the live venue with a sacred spear...

522
00:33:37,348 --> 00:33:40,848
つい…力を解放してしまった…
I accidentally... unleashed my power...

523
